TO: All District Education Board Secretaries (DEBS)
FROM: Office of Major Dr. Kabanga Allan

RE: National Language Awareness Week (10–17 June 2025)

Please be advised that the Ministry endorses the NLAW campaign to promote the role of indigenous languages in national development. Kindly organize school debates, radio segments, and community civic activities in support of the National Languages (Official Status) Bill, 2025.

Sincerely,

Major Dr. Kabanga Allan
